    <node id="ModerateAutism_0_0">
      <data key="d0">An autistic cognitive architecture that prioritizes local sensory detail over global coherence, operates through concrete-visual representations, requires explicit rule structures, and regulates learning through predictable, closed-loop feedback, expressed at attenuated intensity across all domains.</data>
